Amp.overview:
{{Amp nav}}
{{Status infobox
|Amp
|Amped targets deal more DMG of the Element it is Amped for. The number represents the degree of increase. Effects of the same type can stack.
|image = 
|type = Buff
|source = Operator
}}

{{Icon|Amp icon|Amp}} is a category of buffs applied to operators in Arknights: Endfield.

As of October 2026, there are currently no operators who directly apply Amp. When operators are affected by a type of Amp, they temporarily deal more damage for a set duration based on the type applied and the Element of the incoming damage. The number represents the degree of increase.

An operator that is Arts Amped is also considered Amped to all Arts Elements. For example, while Flickers in the Mist's passive only explicitly states that it is triggered from the wielder gaining Electric Amp, gaining Arts Amp through an equipping {{Icon|Xaihi icon|Xaihi's}} Battle Skill Distributed DoS also triggers the weapon's passive.

Multiple sources of Amp stack additively to form the Amp Multiplier for that damage instance. The resulting Amp Mulitplier stacks multiplicatively with other damage multipliers to get the final value. For more information on calculating damage, see Damage calculation.
{{Clr}}

