{{Icon|Cryo Amp icon|Cryo Amp}} is a type of buff applied to operators in Arknights: Endfield.

When operators are affected by Cryo Amp, they temporarily deal more Cryo DMG. The number represents the degree of increase.

Multiple sources of Cryo Amp, as well as Arts Amp stack additively to form the Amp Multiplier for that damage instance. The resulting Amp Mulitplier stacks multiplicatively with other damage multipliers to get the final value. For more information on calculating damage, see Damage calculation.
{{Clr}}

