Electric Amp.lead:
{{Amp nav}}
{{Status infobox
|Electric Amp
|Electric Amped targets temporarily deal more Electric DMG. The number represents the degree of increase. Effects of the same type can stack.
|image = 
|type = Buff
|source = Operator
}}
{{Icon|Electric Amp icon|Electric Amp}} is a type of buff applied to operators in Arknights: Endfield.

When operators are affected by Electric Amp, they temporarily deal more Electric DMG. The number represents the degree of increase.

An operator that is Arts Amped is also considered Electric Amped. For example, while Flickers in the Mist's passive only explicitly states that it is triggered from the wielder gaining Electric Amp, gaining Arts Amp through an equipping {{Icon|Xaihi icon|Xaihi's}} Battle Skill Distributed DoS also triggers the weapon's passive.

Multiple sources of Electric Amp, as well as Arts Amp stack additively to form the Amp Multiplier for that damage instance. The resulting Amp Mulitplier stacks multiplicatively with other damage multipliers to get the final value. For more information on calculating damage, see Damage calculation.
{{Clr}}

