Immobilization is a crowd control status effect in Arknights: Endfield.

When an enemy is affected is Immobilized, they cannot perform any actions for the duration of this effect. Multiple sources of Immobilization do not stack additively and the target remains immobilized until the latest active immobilize effect expires.

