Knock Down.lead:
{{Physical Status tab}}
{{Status infobox
|Knock Down
|Applies Vulnerable on an enemy. If the enemy is already Vulnerable, then add 1 stack of Vulnerable, and deal Physical DMG and Stagger.
|image = 
|type = Debuff, Crowd Control, Damage Instance
|source = Operator
}}
{{Icon|Knock Down icon|Knock Down}} is a type of debuff, crowd control, and damage instance applied to enemies in Arknights: Endfield.

When an operator applies Knock Down to an enemy that is not currently Vulnerable, a stack of Vulnerability is applied instead. Otherwise, it deals 120% ATK Physical DMG of the triggering operator, applies 10 Stagger, and applies a stack of Vulnerability.

Weaker enemies are briefly Knocked Down into the ground for 1 second. Stronger enemies are immune to the crowd control effect but will continue to receive the additional damage, stagger, and Vulnerability debuff.

Knock Down can be forcibly applied by some operators without requiring the enemy to be Vulnerable.

{{TOC limit|2}}
{{Clr}}

