Lift.lead:
{{Physical Status tab}}
{{Status infobox
|Lift
|Applies Vulnerable on an enemy. If the enemy is already Vulnerable, then add 1 stack of Vulnerable, and deal Physical DMG and Stagger.
|image = 
|type = Debuff, Crowd Control, Damage Instance
|source = Operator
}}

{{Icon|Lift icon|Lift}} is a type of debuff, crowd control, and damage instance applied to enemies in Arknights: Endfield.

When an operator applies Lift to an enemy that is not currently Vulnerable, a stack of Vulnerability is applied instead. Otherwise, it deals 120% ATK Physical DMG of the triggering operator, applies 10 Stagger, and applies a stack of Vulnerability.

Weaker enemies are briefly Lifted into the air and are unable to act for 1 second. Some operators such as {{Icon|Chen Qianyu icon|Chen Qianyu}} are able to lift the enemy for a longer duration. Stronger enemies are immune to the crowd control effect but will continue to receive the additional damage, stagger and Vulnerability debuff.

Lift can be forcibly applied by some operators without requiring the enemy to be Vulnerable.

{{TOC limit|2}}
{{Clr}}

