{{Icon|Nature Amp icon|Nature Amp}} is a type of buff applied to operators in Arknights: Endfield.

When operators are affected by Nature Amp, they temporarily deal more Nature DMG. The number represents the degree of increase.

Multiple sources of Nature Amp, as well as Arts Amp stack additively to form the Amp Multiplier for that damage instance. The resulting Amp Mulitplier stacks multiplicatively with other damage multipliers to get the final value. For more information on calculating damage, see Damage calculation.
