{{Icon|Nature Susceptibility icon|text=false|nolink=true}} Nature Susceptibility is a type of debuff inflicted to enemies in Arknights: Endfield.

When enemies are inflicted with Nature Susceptibility, they temporarily take more Nature DMG. The number represents the degree of increase.

Multiple sources of Nature Susceptibility, as well as Arts Susceptibility, stack additively to form the Susceptibility Multiplier for that DMG instance. The resulting Susceptibility Multiplier then stacks multiplicatively with other damage multipliers to get the final value. For more information on calculating damage, see Damage calculation.
