Physical Status.lead:
{{Physical Status tab}}
{{Status infobox
|Physical Status
|Physical Statuses refer to physical debuffs applied to the enemy. The include: Lifted, Knocked Down, Crushed and Breached.
|type = Debuff
|source = Operator
}}
Physical Status is a category of debuffs applied to enemies in Arknights: Endfield.

When an operator attempts to apply a type of Physical Status to an enemy that is not currently Vulnerable, a stack of Vulnerability is applied instead. Otherwise, the effects based on the type of Physical Status is triggered.

Some Physical Statuses such as Lift and Knock Down can be forcibly applied to trigger Lifted and Knocked Down respectively without requiring the enemy to be Vulnerable.

Applying a Physical Status to an enemy affected by Solidification consumes the Solidification and applies Shatter: Deals 240 — 600% ATK Physical DMG of the triggering operator based on the Status Level of the Solidification.
{{TOC limit|3}}
{{Clr}}

