Shield is a type of buff applied to operators in Arknights: Endfield.

When an operator in the team casts a Combat Skill that grants Shield, any incoming damage that would otherwise reduce the operator's health reduces the operator's Shield instead for a set duration. If the Shield is reduced to zero, any effects that are granted while the Shield is active such as {{Icon|Ember icon|Ember's}} {{Icon|Potential 5|The Steel Oath}} is removed.
