{{Icon|Haste icon|Slow}} is a type of debuff applied to enemies in Arknights: Endfield.

When targets are affected by Slow, they temporarily have decreased movement speed. The number represents the degree of reduction known as the Slow Multiplier.

Multiple sources of Slow do not stack and only the highest Slow Multiplier is used. It is currently unknown how Slow and Haste stack with each other.
