Vulnerability.lead:
{{Physical Status tab}}
{{Status infobox
|Vulnerability
|Hitting an enemy for the first time with a skill with Physical Status applies Vulnerable instead of the actual Physical Status.
A Vulnerable enemy can be Lifted and Knocked Down to add more Vulnerable stacks (up to 4). Hitting a Vulnerable enemy with Crush or Breach will consume the Vulnerable stacks.
|image = 
|type = Debuff
|source = Operator
}}
{{Icon|Vulnerable icon|Vulnerability}} or Vulnerable is a type of debuff in Arknights: Endfield.

When an operator attempts to apply a Physical Status but the enemy is not initially Vulnerable, the operator will instead apply a stack of Vulnerability, stacking up to four times.

Applying Vulnerability to an enemy affected by Solidification consumes the Solidification and applies Shatter: Deals 240 — 600% ATK Physical DMG of the triggering operator based on the Status Level of the Solidification.

{{TOC limit|3}}

{{Clr}}

